@JwtAuthDemo_HostAddress = https://localhost:7042

### 1️⃣ Login to get JWT token
POST {{JwtAuthDemo_HostAddress}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tayyab",
  "password": "1234"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### 2️⃣ Public endpoint (no auth)
GET {{JwtAuthDemo_HostAddress}}/public
Accept: application/json

### 3️⃣ Protected endpoint (requires Bearer token)
GET {{JwtAuthDemo_HostAddress}}/protected
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### 4️⃣ Admin-only endpoint (requires Admin role)
GET {{JwtAuthDemo_HostAddress}}/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
